00:04:00.399 --> 00:04:02.800
Welcome everyone. My name is Janine

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:07.800
My pronouns are she her I want to welcome you to the table today

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:13.600
Thank you. All you folks online for coming and being with us have a couple of announcements for y'all

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:19.279
First of all on Friday, January the 23rd, we are going to have a game night

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:24.959
so it's going to be in the Family Life Center, which is back here on the back of the property and

00:04:25.679 --> 00:04:33.040
We would just love for you to bring a game or a dessert because there is going to be a pasta bar

00:04:33.799 --> 00:04:36.119
Awesome, who doesn't love some pasta?

00:04:37.119 --> 00:04:40.359
and we are so grateful for this wonderful chance to

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:45.040
Connect and have deeper connections with our community

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:54.480
Also, we need to remind you that on Super Bowl Sunday in order for everybody to be able to do everything that they need to

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:59.359
Do that day we are going to bump the service up to 3.30

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:01.880
So that is February the 8th

00:05:02.519 --> 00:05:04.519
services begin at 3.30

00:05:05.679 --> 00:05:07.320
All right

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:14.399
I know sometimes it can be hard to walk in the church. Sometimes it may be that your

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:18.160
inner self is just anxious or fidgety and

00:05:18.679 --> 00:05:23.440
so in order to accommodate those who may need it we have a

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:27.760
Accessibility bucket, it's the black one over there on the little table

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:35.239
And it has noise cancelling headphones and different things that you can fidget around with or you can color draw

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:37.320
Whatever might make you feel

00:05:37.559 --> 00:05:39.559
much more comfortable here

00:05:41.519 --> 00:05:43.720
The candles that I have lit are

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:48.040
Representative of Christ among us

00:05:49.239 --> 00:05:52.440
fully human and fully divine

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:56.440
So

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:59.559
Now

00:05:59.559 --> 00:06:03.679
let's exit the kingdom of noise and hurry and

00:06:04.519 --> 00:06:06.519
productivity and

00:06:06.519 --> 00:06:08.519
let's enter the kingdom of

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:11.160
silence and stillness and

00:06:11.959 --> 00:06:13.959
simplicity a

00:06:14.079 --> 00:06:16.079
sacred space

00:06:16.399 --> 00:06:18.399
a place for prayer

00:06:18.839 --> 00:06:20.640
worship and

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:22.079
adoration

00:06:22.239 --> 00:06:24.239
A place to behold Christ

00:06:25.079 --> 00:06:27.079
the revelation of God

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:29.480
the heartbeat of creation

00:06:30.799 --> 00:06:33.399
