00:32:04.520 --> 00:32:06.520
the kind of goal or purpose

00:32:06.520 --> 00:32:08.520
or aim, it's like the original intent

00:32:08.520 --> 00:32:10.520
and now we're crowded out by other fears

00:32:10.520 --> 00:32:12.520
or anxieties or concerns

00:32:12.520 --> 00:32:14.520
