00:32:16.520 --> 00:32:18.520
our way

00:32:18.520 --> 00:32:20.520
and in essence

00:32:20.520 --> 00:32:22.520
you might say that

00:32:22.520 --> 00:32:24.520
in a Christian community

00:32:24.520 --> 00:32:26.520
our goal here, the end point

00:32:26.520 --> 00:32:28.520
of all of our prayers and worship and liturgy

00:32:28.520 --> 00:32:30.520
and community and acts of service

00:32:30.520 --> 00:32:32.520
what is it? I would say it's something like this

00:32:32.520 --> 00:32:34.520
the goal of the Christian life is to become

00:32:34.520 --> 00:32:36.520
people saturated

00:32:36.520 --> 00:32:38.520
with God's great love

00:32:38.520 --> 00:32:40.520
and I think this is really key

00:32:40.520 --> 00:32:42.520
to remember

00:32:42.520 --> 00:32:44.520
because there's a lot of verses in the Bible

00:32:44.520 --> 00:32:46.520
and there's a lot of theology

00:32:46.520 --> 00:32:48.520
and we can get off on all sorts of

00:32:48.520 --> 00:32:50.520
weird tangents. Paul gives

00:32:50.520 --> 00:32:52.520
of course a kind of poetic description of this in 1 Corinthians

00:32:52.520 --> 00:32:54.520
chapter 13 verses 4-8

00:32:54.520 --> 00:32:56.520
where he describes

00:32:56.520 --> 00:32:58.520
love and just says love is patient

00:32:58.520 --> 00:33:00.520
it's kind, it does not envy

00:33:00.520 --> 00:33:02.520
it does not boast, it is not proud

00:33:02.520 --> 00:33:04.520
it does not dishonor others

00:33:04.520 --> 00:33:06.520
it is not self-seeking, it is not

00:33:06.520 --> 00:33:08.520
easily angered, it keeps no record of wrongs

00:33:08.520 --> 00:33:10.520
love does not delight in evil

00:33:10.520 --> 00:33:12.520
but rejoices with the

00:33:12.520 --> 00:33:14.520
truth. So it's like this

00:33:14.520 --> 00:33:16.520
is the heart

00:33:16.520 --> 00:33:18.520
of so much of the Christian

00:33:18.520 --> 00:33:20.520
faith, this is what we're to be

00:33:20.520 --> 00:33:22.520
about and you

00:33:22.520 --> 00:33:24.520
can see though where this is

00:33:24.520 --> 00:33:26.520
kind of a, it's like a shift or it's a change

00:33:26.520 --> 00:33:28.520
in certain people's mind, it kind of

00:33:28.520 --> 00:33:30.520
upends in a lot of ways our definition

00:33:30.520 --> 00:33:32.520
of success and if you

00:33:32.520 --> 00:33:34.520
kind of contrast this with

00:33:34.520 --> 00:33:36.520
the broader society

00:33:36.520 --> 00:33:38.520
it almost sounds like an insane goal, you're like

00:33:38.520 --> 00:33:40.520
what's the purpose of your life? To become

00:33:40.520 --> 00:33:42.520
saturated by God's love

00:33:42.520 --> 00:33:44.520
for every person, every being

00:33:44.520 --> 00:33:46.520
every creature, it would just be like

00:33:46.520 --> 00:33:48.520
weird, this is just not

00:33:48.520 --> 00:33:50.520
what we're about. I think of the broader world

00:33:50.520 --> 00:33:52.520
in a lot of ways we're pretty much a society

00:33:52.520 --> 00:33:54.520
kind of built around

00:33:54.520 --> 00:33:56.520
something like money making, that's kind of

00:33:56.520 --> 00:33:58.520
like career is everything, career is honestly identity

